%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-xml (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
    users: {
      company: "MuleSoft",
      user @(name: "Leandro",lastName: "Shokida"): "",
      user @(name: "Mariano",lastName: "Achaval"): ""
    }
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload application/xml
<users>
  <company>MuleSoft</company>
  <user name="Leandro" lastName="Shokida"/>
  <user name="Mariano" lastName="Achaval"/>
</users>
%%% output application/dw
{
  users: {
    company: "MuleSoft",
    user @(name: "Leandro", lastName: "Shokida"): null,
    user @(name: "Mariano", lastName: "Achaval"): null
  }
} as Object {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "application/xml"}
